Package: arfexplorer
Type: Package
Title: Learning Demo for Adversarial Random Forests
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Jehangeer", "Menghwar",
    email = "menghwwarjehangeer@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An introductory 'shiny' application for exploring mixed
    tabular data, generating synthetic data with the 'arf' package,
    and comparing empirical distributions and numerical dependencies
    against held-out real data. Designed for learning and demonstration.
